&lt;p&gt;JD and active membership in good standing with at least one U.S. state bar&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;5+ years of relevant transactional experience in-house at a technology company or in a technology practice group at a top law firm&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Exceptional drafting skills&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience in marketing tech, adtech, fintech, payments, or financial services&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience supporting global or multi-jurisdictional transactions&amp;nbsp; (e.g., Canada, US, UK/EU, Australia)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong working knowledge of data protection and privacy regimes such as CCPA, GDPR, APPs, PIPEDA, and GLBA&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
