&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 2;&quot;&gt;Demonstrated experience directly managing and developing senior, quota-carrying Account Executives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 2;&quot;&gt;Proven success leading teams through large, complex sales cycles involving executive stakeholders, commercial negotiations, and significant cross-functional coordination&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 2;&quot;&gt;Strong alignment with Affirm’s mission and a clear understanding of the value Affirm delivers to merchants and consumers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 2;&quot;&gt;Experience selling to large retail merchants, ideally in payments, fintech, commerce, or another complex solution-selling environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 2;&quot;&gt;Strong judgment, communication, and executive presence, with the ability to build trust and influence C-level merchant stakeholders and senior internal partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 2;&quot;&gt;Track record of developing high-performing sales talent, improving performance, and creating consistent operating discipline across a team&lt;/li&gt;
