&lt;li&gt;Forecast the demand for TAMs and recruit as necessary&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technically, you will evaluate new hires on their technical capabilities, handle escalations from your own team, provide guidance to the TAMs on integration solutions, troubleshooting and optimization opportunities, and be seen as an expert by our customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be a strong internal advocate for our merchants, working cross functionally to make sure their highest priorities are being met&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we look for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
