&lt;p&gt;Actively participate in deals alongside your team, supporting live technical discovery, integration discussions, and solution presentations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Partner with merchant technical and business leaders when an opportunity requires leadership involvement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Develop and maintain deep working knowledge of Affirm’s products, APIs, and integration options so you can evaluate solutions, explain tradeoffs, and help resolve technical blockers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Build, test, and troubleshoot integrations in sandbox or simulated merchant environments, and coach the team to develop the same practical capabilities.&lt;/p&gt;
