&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will drive alignment across multiple organizations and influence roadmaps on partner experience and foundational teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will partner across Product, Design, and Analytics, and other Engineering teams, building trust and taking part in cross-functional efforts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
