&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we look for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;You have 8+ years of experience designing, developing and launching backend systems at scale using languages like Python or Kotlin, and 2+ years of experience managing a software team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have an extensive track record of developing highly available distributed systems using technologies like AWS, MySQL, Spark and Kubernetes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience in financial systems, ledgering, treasury or adjacent domains where data accuracy and system reliability are critical.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You understand how to manage a high performance team, delivering successfully by growing the team, coaching engineers, and aligning stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
