&lt;li&gt;Proven experience designing business processes that drive a positive end user experience, reduce business risk and increase overall workflow efficiency.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building workflows within a regulatory environment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel as needed to support team collaboration, operational priorities, and vendor or partner engagements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
