&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Exposure to IAM, IGA, SSO, SAML, OIDC, SCIM, RBAC, or identity governance&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience with SailPoint, Auth0, Okta, OneLogin, or similar platforms&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience with Terraform or other infrastructure-as-code tools&lt;/p&gt;
