&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Oversee our Marketing Services team to make sure they are deploying co-marketing investments in the most efficient way possible to support our merchant partnerships.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Lead the Marketplace Partnerships, Partner Marketing, and Platform Marketing teams through experienced people leaders, setting clear priorities, operating models, and measures of success.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
