&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Set the strategy for how Affirm deploys merchant and Affirm-funded marketing investments, balancing partner commitments, business priorities, consumer impact, and return on investment to maximize the value of our co-marketing programs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
