&lt;li&gt;Design and build scalable backend systems, APIs, and data models that power communications, experimentation, and personalization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Product Managers, Data Scientists, and Analysts to define and execute strategies for customer acquisition and engagement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish and uphold engineering best practices to ensure services are secure, observable, and performant at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor and support junior engineers, contributing to a culture of learning, collaboration, and technical excellence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
