&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6+ years of experience as a Software Engineer with a focus on backend systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of distributed systems, service-oriented architecture, and how architectural choices affect scalability, reliability, and maintainability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of delivering complex backend systems in production environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills, with proficiency in asynchronous communication (design docs, technical specs, project plans, etc.).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to collaborate effectively across Product, Data Science, Analytics, and Design teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in Python, Kotlin, or similar languages (experience with both is a plus).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with AWS or other major cloud providers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in a related field or equivalent practical experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with experimentation platforms (A/B testing frameworks, feature flagging systems).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with event-driven architectures and stream processing tools (e.g., Kafka, Kinesis).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to large-scale personalization, recommendation, or messaging systems.&lt;/li&gt;
