&lt;p&gt;We believe the people building honest financial products at Affirm should share in its success.&amp;nbsp;That&#39;s why our total rewards are designed to support your health, growth, financial well-being,&amp;nbsp;and future.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In service of our mission, we reward employees through a combination of base pay, equity (from parent company), and comprehensive benefits.&lt;/p&gt;
