&lt;p&gt;Affirm also provides flexible spending wallets to all employees for technology and wellbeing&amp;nbsp;related needs, which are reimbursable up to 1390 zł per month.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In addition to your compensation, our comprehensive benefits&amp;nbsp;are designed to support you and the people who matter most. Benefits include:&lt;/p&gt;
