&lt;li data-start=&quot;225&quot; data-end=&quot;430&quot;&gt;You have experience working across the React Native and native boundaries (Swift/Kotlin), debugging platform-specific issues and improving developer tooling, CI/CD, and release processes for mobile apps.&lt;/li&gt;
