&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the vision – Define the technical direction, long-term technical roadmap, and strategic initiatives in Cards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be a role model - Lead from the front as an example in using AI to build fast, take initiative, and revolutionize how we work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay close to industry leaders in FinTech, learning from what is happening in the market to build our team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with stakeholders across all teams at Affirm to champion and implement technical excellence in conjunction with business results&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create and influence a strong ownership culture across teams, with high accountability and investment for building for scale and efficiency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Architect and contribute to decisions on the right platform, tools, and technologies to support consistency and reliability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor and lead – Guide a strong group of engineers by championing best practices, and helping them grow&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
