&lt;li&gt;You stay up-to-date on native OS releases and can anticipate how they land in a React Native app&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience with mobile testing and observability tooling — E2E frameworks like Maestro/Appium, crash reporting Sentry/Crashlytics, and experimentation/feature-flagging platforms like Statsig/LaunchDarkly — and enjoy building tooling other teams actually adopt.&lt;/li&gt;
